{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>成龍與太太林鳳嬌的獨子房祖名（Jaycee），自2014年捲入負面新聞後演藝事業全面停擺，近年生活極低調，絕跡幕前，曾多次傳出在台北購入豪宅及低調秘婚的消息，但均未獲證實。日前日本獨立製錶師Masaharu Nakajima（中島正晴）在社交平台曬出多張合照，令神隱多時的房祖名近照曝光！</p><figure><img alt=\"房祖名。（IG@jaycee_chan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230801/763044486057693184458913.jpeg/fvux4HPCM019nYbjdz0GZ7iFoltjDZ2jE2-zGRNvsxk\"/><figcaption>房祖名。（IG@jaycee_chan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"曾多次傳出在台北購入豪宅。（IG@jaycee_chan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230801/763044477161050112345198.jpeg/KS4bmzhwT10jJPvXzrg5yA5TFMUIXsitGnCtkhpwrZI\"/><figcaption>曾多次傳出在台北購入豪宅。（IG@jaycee_chan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"房祖名同陳奕迅。（IG@jaycee_chan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230801/763044493704433664315907.jpeg/8pGDgC_bzyGfrcH1M1y7vWMqvqxzevwv3RB6zd0Qes0\"/><figcaption>房祖名同陳奕迅。（IG@jaycee_chan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"近年絕跡幕前。（IG@jaycee_chan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230801/763044477773418496928617.jpeg/6Vmw3f_uRQ6XgByoaph7EYPB183KAU71G2czExtnMxM\"/><figcaption>近年絕跡幕前。（IG@jaycee_chan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊毅敏曬出與房祖名及謝賢的合照。（IG@anastamosis3）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260722/1156563749822271488840312.jpeg/AX-A6vueAKpJNztoCQFf7eq3moAuC9L0eDLy_Hgy8vw\"/><figcaption>楊毅敏曬出與房祖名及謝賢的合照。（IG@anastamosis3）</figcaption></figure><p>房祖名全黑休閒裝現身日本製錶工作室　獲大讚友善親切</p><p>從Masaharu Nakajima分享的照片可見，房祖名親自到訪其位於日本東京的獨立製錶工作室參觀交流，向來打扮低調的房祖名，當日戴着黑色Cap帽及圓框眼鏡，身穿全黑寬鬆短袖T恤及黑色長褲，手上佩戴着一枚名貴腕錶，久未露面的他面色紅潤、精神飽滿，面對鏡頭展露燦爛笑容。房祖名在工作室內不但與製錶團隊大合照，更與Masaharu Nakajima握手留念，隨後一行人又到日式小店舉杯小酌，氣氛相當融洽。Masaharu Nakajima在帖文中更大讚房祖名毫無架子：「Jaycee Chan is really friendly and kind. We had a great time with him!（房祖名非常友善親切，我們與他度過了愉快的時光！）」</p><figure><img alt=\"房祖名與Masaharu Nakajima握手留念。（IG@masa1963_nakajima）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261114/1198334190589054976648725.jpeg/7hkaCg6S_6N7Be5U9FKUKLd0MARL9RMjRp5d0UaeXdE\"/><figcaption>房祖名與Masaharu Nakajima握手留念。（IG@masa1963_nakajima）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"近照曝光！（IG@masa1963_nakajima）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261114/1198334188537909248760235.jpeg/5P3baMbcLJmlP9fs7j8R2J4VE8cYcIzcgABgFYAAYBU\"/><figcaption>近照曝光！（IG@masa1963_nakajima）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大合照。（IG@masa1963_nakajima）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261114/1198334278123917312019235.jpeg/XXTb7kkT_hD1fHI9oiElxqgzk091cAKSiJoR3oiaEd4\"/><figcaption>大合照。（IG@masa1963_nakajima）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"狀態大勇！（IG@masa1963_nakajima）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261114/1198334186109276160635802.jpeg/UlF0nWhmB7Seu2YenkMnqOe9jMPTH-NpXRHMp10RzKc\"/><figcaption>狀態大勇！（IG@masa1963_nakajima）</figcaption></figure><p>房祖名淡出幕前轉戰商界　神隱多年傳秘婚</p><p>房祖名自淡出幕前後，近年轉型低調從商，先後涉足雪茄及龍舌蘭酒品牌生意，同時亦是頂級名錶收藏家，更曾出任頂級名錶品牌Richard Mille亞洲區董事。感情方面，房祖名過去緋聞多多，近年曾傳出他與年輕11歲的內地模特兒兼歌手葉子淇低調秘婚並定居台灣，有報道指他不但在台北購置豪宅作為愛巢，更曾豪擲逾500萬人民幣（約588萬港元）在上海為女方置產，但當事人一直未有公開回應。</p><figure><img alt=\"成龍與房祖名曾現身瑞士。（小紅書圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250806/1029803296715575296805237.png/5tl3pNUfq5nJegpZJlzDS09kcGXFyeoSEWx_QBFsf0A\"/><figcaption>成龍與房祖名曾現身瑞士。（小紅書圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有網民在惠州偶遇房祖名，左手無名指戴戒指，疑似秘婚。（小紅書圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260713/1153284668242530304906348.png/t0t5CG_NTDI-56ZpgWhKhAf9bjTn3eV-xVHMr8VRzK8\"/><figcaption>有網民在惠州偶遇房祖名，左手無名指戴戒指，疑似秘婚。（小紅書圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"近年傳出與年輕11歲的內地模特兒兼歌手葉子淇低調秘婚並定居台灣。（IG@annakay_47）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261114/1198335796856623104678205.jpeg/2rojX0oLiaw4g55yQ_mzLc--2r1xAM0h8VTIQPFUyEA\"/><figcaption>近年傳出與年輕11歲的內地模特兒兼歌手葉子淇低調秘婚並定居台灣。（IG@annakay_47）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"2013年郭富城與熊黛林分手後，葉子淇曾被傳出入郭富城居所，因而一度獲得「天王嫂」的稱號。（IG@annakay_47）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261114/1198335794704814080013598.jpeg/uRBFV03i1ZlCT2UimIm_XIBHMQqJKQw4t7hwH7e4cB8\"/><figcaption>2013年郭富城與熊黛林分手後，葉子淇曾被傳出入郭富城居所，因而一度獲得「天王嫂」的稱號。（IG@annakay_47）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"葉子淇。（IG@annakay_47）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261114/1198335792469118976623794.jpeg/4F1tKgD_d8AzyQn48DRAULp161z8wOxRE2DOQBNgzkA\"/><figcaption>葉子淇。（IG@annakay_47）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有報道指他不但在台北購置豪宅作為愛巢，更曾豪擲逾500萬人民幣（約588萬港元）在上海為女方置產。（IG@annakay_47）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261114/1198335790065651712175249.jpeg/uUIknTWGwlg2AagtojohZc9UJxSvdzk01OkVutTpFbo\"/><figcaption>有報道指他不但在台北購置豪宅作為愛巢，更曾豪擲逾500萬人民幣（約588萬港元）在上海為女方置產。（IG@annakay_47）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T15:27:03.264838+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1223,"images":15,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T15:00:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T15:43:15.157444+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T15:20:32.657560+00:00","content_hash":"02af065e01ff458aae82d8528a3c7862ef659413d2180022cf655ee763f651ee","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}